  "claim": "A British film from 2000 features James Bond actor Daniel Craig. That film stars the actor who played Inspector Banks in \"DCI Banks.\"",
  "evidencia": "Page: Hotel Splendide (film). Sentence: Hotel Splendide is a 2000 British independent dark comedy film, written and directed by Terence Gross and starring Toni Collette and Daniel Craig.\nPage: Daniel Craig. Sentence: Cast as the British secret agent James Bond in October 2005, his first film in the role, \"Casino Royale\", was released internationally in November 2006.\nPage: Stephen Tompkinson. Sentence: He also starred in the films \"Brassed Off\" (1996) and \"Hotel Splendide\" (2000).\nPage: Inspector Alan Banks. Sentence: Since 2010 several of the novels have been adapted for television under the series title \"DCI Banks\" with Stephen Tompkinson in the lead role.",
