        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Daniel Craig, Stephen Tompkinson, Terence Gross, Toni Collette\n- Works: Hotel Splendide, Brassed Off, Casino Royale, Inspector Alan Banks, DCI Banks\n- Roles: James Bond\n\nFacts:\n- Stephen Tompkinson starred in the film Brassed Off in 1996.\n- Hotel Splendide is a 2000 British independent dark comedy film written and directed by Terence Gross.\n- Hotel Splendide stars Toni Collette and Daniel Craig.\n- Stephen Tompkinson also starred in Hotel Splendide in 2000.\n- Daniel Craig was cast as the British secret agent James Bond in October 2005.\n- Daniel Craig's first James Bond film, Casino Royale, was released internationally in November 2006.\n- Since 2010, several Inspector Alan Banks novels have been adapted for television as the series DCI Banks.\n- Since 2010, Stephen Tompkinson has played the lead role in DCI Banks.",
